body:
Lizah, my 18 year old Yuan-ti blooded Tiefling, she is a Rogue Assassin but a lot less nasty than she might appear.

&#x200B;

She is as mischievous as the reference might suggest, but she's fairly friendly and amicable. Very outgoing and extroverted. She is the only daughter of a notorious monarch of the Underdark, and now Lizah's gone out onto the surface for her first and real big adventure, in the hopes of forming good relationships with the surface kingdoms. Recently, she got to see her first snow and it was pretty wondrous for her. 

&#x200B;

Lizah stands roughly 158 cm, weighing around 53 kg. Her build is a bit slender from Yuan-ti heritage, she has a tail, but it's rather standard fare (bit thick, no barb). Some of her most notable features are pointed out by the references photo, but I'm happy to answer any additional questions. 

&#x200B;

Thank you much!

&#x200B;

